      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.roll-drauf-note",
      "text": "This chapter presents the Wizard. Start with the Core Wizard Traits table and the Wizard Features table, then read the class features in level order. The Wizard Spell List names every spell the class can prepare. The Evoker subclass follows at the end.",
