      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "level": 4,
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.becoming-a-wizard.as-a-level-1-character",
      "text": "As a Level 1 Character",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "Gain all the traits in the Core Wizard Traits table.",
        "Gain the Wizard’s level 1 features, which are listed in the Wizard Features table."
      ],
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.becoming-a-wizard.as-a-level-1-character.list-1",
      "type": "unordered-list"
    },
    {
      "level": 4,
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.becoming-a-wizard.as-a-multiclass-character",
      "text": "As a Multiclass Character",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "items": [
        "Gain the Hit Point Die from the Core Wizard Traits table.",
        "Gain the Wizard’s level 1 features, which are listed in the Wizard Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
      ],
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.becoming-a-wizard.as-a-multiclass-character.list-1",
      "type": "unordered-list"
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.wizard-class-features",
      "text": "Wizard Class Features",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.wizard-class-features.p-1",
      "text": "As a Wizard, you gain the following class features when you reach the specified Wizard levels. These features are listed in the Wizard Features table.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 4,
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.wizard-class-features.level-1-spellcasting",
      "text": "Level 1: Spellcasting",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.wizard-class-features.level-1-spellcasting.p-1",
      "text": "As a student of arcane magic, you have learned to cast spells. See “Spells” for the rules on spellcasting. The information below details how you use those rules with Wizard spells, which appear in the Wizard spell list later in the class’s description.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "ruleId": "classes.wizard.wizard-class-features.level-1-spellcasting.p-2",
      "text": "Cantrips. You know three Wizard cantrips of your choice. Light, Mage Hand, and Ray of Frost are recommended. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace one of your cantrips from this feature with another Wizard cantrip of your choice.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
